Program: adeff.sas
Purpose: Create ADEFF (Efficacy Analysis Dataset) - BDS Structure
Standard: CDISC ADaM IG 1.3

PROC CONTENTS data=adeff varnum;
Observations: 50
Variables: 27

Variables in creation order:
 1  STUDYID     Study Identifier
 2  USUBJID     Unique Subject Identifier
 3  ASEQ        Analysis Sequence Number
 4  PARAMCD     Parameter Code
 5  PARAM       Parameter
 6  PARAMN      Parameter (N)
 7  AVAL        Analysis Value
 8  AVALC       Analysis Value (C)
 9  AVALU       Analysis Value Unit
10  BASE        Baseline Value
11  CHG         Change from Baseline
12  PCHG        Percent Change from Baseline
13  ADT         Analysis Date
14  ADY         Analysis Relative Day
15  AVISIT      Analysis Visit
16  AVISITN     Analysis Visit (N)
17  ABLFL       Baseline Record Flag
18  ANL01FL     Analysis Record Flag 01
19  RSCAT       Response Category
20  TRTP        Planned Treatment
21  TRTPN       Planned Treatment (N)
22  EFFFL       Efficacy Population Flag
23  SAFFL       Safety Population Flag
24  TRTSDT      Treatment Start Date
25  TRTEDT      Treatment End Date
26  AGE         Age
27  SEX         Sex

PROC PRINT data=adeff noobs;

